<title>MEXICO: Mexico's stock market closes at unofficial record.</title>
<headline>Mexico's stock market closes at unofficial record.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's stock market closed at an unofficial record of 4,476.19 points on Friday, up 0.25 percent or 11.21 points.</p>
<p>Dealers said the gains were principally in middle-sized companies, and that players took profits on shares of largest companies.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Redaccion Mexico 525 72895 62))</p>
